ng to the French National Institute for Statistics and Economic Studies (INSEE), Torcy-et-Pouligny is indeed part of the canton of Semur-en-Auxois.\"}, {\"id\": \"s8\", \"text\": \"[1] This information is also corroborated by the official website of the Côte-d'Or department, which lists Torcy-et-Pouligny as one of the communes within the canton.\"}, {\"id\": \"s9\", \"text\": \"[2]\"}, {\"id\": \"s10\", \"text\": \"Furthermore, the French Ministry of the Interior's website, which provides information on the country's administrative divisions, also confirms that Torcy-et-Pouligny is part of the canton of Semur-en-Auxois.\"}, {\"id\": \"s11\", \"text\": \"[3]\"}, {\"id\": \"s12\", \"text\": \"**References**\"}, {\"id\": \"s13\", \"text\": \"[1] INSEE.\"}, {\"id\": \"s14\", \"text\": \"(n.d.).\"}, {\"id\": \"s15\", \"text\": \"Torcy-et-Pouligny.\"}, {\"id\": \"s16\", \"text\": \"Retrieved from <https:\\\\/\\\\/www.insee.fr\\\\/fr\\\\/definition\\\\/21234>\"}, {\"id\": \"s17\", \"text\": \"[2] Côte-d'Or Department.\"}, {\"id\": \"s18\", \"text\": \"(n.d.).\"}, {\"id\": \"s19\", \"text\": \"Canton de Semur-en-Auxois.\"}, {\"id\": \"s20\", \"text\": \"Retrieved from <https:\\\\/\\\\/www.cote-dor.fr\\\\/canton-de-semur-en-auxois\\\\/>\"}, {\"id\": \"s21\", \"text\": \"[3] French Ministry of the Interior.\"}, {\"id\": \"s22\", \"text\": \"(n.d.).\"}, {\"id\": \"s23\", \"text\": \"Torcy-et-Pouligny.\"}]}"
